	(text "ISOLATION BLOCK (default variant). Everything left of U3/U4 is host side (GND), right is isolated (GND_ISO).\nU3 ADuM1250: 2-channel bidirectional I2C isolator, side 1 from VSENS, side 2 from VDD_ISO.\nU4 NXE1S0303MC: 1 W isolated 3.3 V DC-DC from VSENS (load budget: VSENS is 100 mA max at 3.0 V).\nR3/R4 4.7k: I2C pull-ups on the ISOLATED side only (the host pull-ups cannot reach across the barrier).\nJ5: INT_ISO test pad. INT does not cross the barrier (ADuM1250 has 2 channels). For a host interrupt\nuse a 3-channel isolator (e.g. ADuM1251/ISO1540 + 1 ch) or poll.\nNon-isolated board: delete this sheet, tie the Sensor sheet pins to VSENS / GND / SENS_SDA / SENS_SCL /\nSENS_INT instead (see README.md)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40.64 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "79e3e9d2-c5be-49c2-8942-04aa2bfa730d")
	)
